OL,3,GNEWSAFake identity fraudster jailed for
OL,4,Asecond time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA convicted fraudster has been jailed
OL,7,Ffor more than two years after taking
OL,8,Fout multiple fraudulent loans with
OL,9,Fstolen identities and forging payslips
OL,10,Fto gamble.
OL,12,FDaniel Robertson, 36, of Burbage Road,
OL,13,FPenhill, Swindon, was sentenced to 30
OL,14,Fmonths at Swindon Crown Court on 23
OL,15,FOctober.
OL,17,FIn 2021, he was released from prison
OL,18,Fafter a four-year sentence for his role
OL,19,Fin a money laundering scheme and he had
OL,20,Frestrictions put on bank accounts but
OL,21,Fpolice found he had breached those
OL,22,Fconditions.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
